"""Garment colours that job 008 left plain.

Job 008 restyled 1,073 colour photos on 355 products, but it skipped a colour whenever its photo's alt text read
"<title> - <colour>", taking that to mean an earlier job had done it. Printful writes the same alt text on its own
mock-ups, so about 1,100 colours on these 321 products were skipped while still on a plain white background.

flatstyle now tells a finished photo by its size instead (styled photos are 1600 x 1600; Printful's are 1000 or 2000),
so this run does every colour on these products that is not already styled, and leaves the styled ones alone.
Same rules as job 008: each colour gets its own photo, a blank Printful mock-up is asked for again on its own and never
swapped in blank, nothing is deleted. Same order as job 008. Stops starting new products after 320 minutes."""
